      "status": "published",
      "summary": "Ability Scores: Strength, Dexterity, Constitution. Feat: Savage Attacker. Skill Proficiencies: Athletics and Intimidation. Tool Proficiency: Choose one kind of Gaming Set. Equipment: Choose A or B: (A) Spear, Shortbow, 20 Arrows, Gaming Set (same as above), Healer's Kit, Quiver, Traveler's Clothes, 14 GP; or (B) 50 GP.",
      "effects": [
